("Judges, current disaster management systems in India are reactive—authorities only mobilize after a landslide occurs and blocks) Tj
T* (highways. BHURAKSHA is an AI-powered Common Operating Picture \(COP\) for the 8 North Eastern Region \(NER\) hill states. It) Tj
T* (fuses 7 real-time telemetry inputs \(IMD rainfall, soil saturation, slope angle, InSAR surface displacement, and historical frequency\)) Tj
T* (into an explainable risk score \(0–100\) with a 6-hour advance forecast. It alerts village committees in 3 regional languages \(English,) Tj
T* (Hindi, Assamese\), manages strategic highway blockages, and generates official NDMA-format PDF SITREPs with one click.") Tj
